<li><a href="/waterdrop/01.Java/JavaCore/%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%5BJavaCore%5D%E6%AD%A3%E5%88%99.html" target="_blank">Java 正则</a> - 关键词：<code>Pattern</code>、<code>Matcher</code>、<code>捕获与非捕获</code>、<code>零宽断言</code>、<code>贪婪与懒惰</code></li>
